{"id":77700,"slug":"billy-the-kid-2022","title":"Billy the Kid","title_en":null,"year":2022,"rating":69,"votes_count":172,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Píše se rok 1871. Dvanáctiletý Billy McCarty a jeho rodina irských přistěhovalců musí opustit New York a vydat se na západ hledat nové příležitosti... Výpravné romantické dobrodružství založené na životě Billyho Kida, od jeho skromných irských kořenů a začátků jako kovboje a pistolníka v americkém pohraničí až po jeho klíčovou roli ve válce v Lincoln County a po ní.(mac000)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/171/487/171487834_5suo9l.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Dobrodružný","Drama","Romantický","Životopisný","Western"],"tags":["Billy Kid"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Michael Nankin","Otto Bathurst","Rachel Leiterman","David Frazee","Adam Kane","John Fawcett"],"actors":["Tom Blyth","Daniel Webber","Dakota Daulby","Siobhan Williams","Chad Rook","Zak Santiago","Vincent Walsh","Joey Batey","Teach Grant","Jason Burkart","Mathias Retamal","Adrian Hough","Eileen O'Higgins","Timothy Webber","Ian Butcher","Jamie Beamish","Ryan Kennedy","Valerie Planche","Jim Byrnes","John Warkentin","Jake Foy","Diego Diablo Del Mar","Jacqueline Robbins","Jordan Zavisha","Trevor Lerner","Jonah Collier","Roger LeBlanc","Marty Antonini","Karen Holness","Michael Adamthwaite","Christie Burke","Emma Pedersen","Gardiner Millar","Milo Shandel","Arpad Balogh","Sean Owen Roberts","Ian Tracey","Alex Roe","Dominic Mariche","Jorge Vargas","Shaun Benson","Luke Camilleri","Brendan Fletcher","Bill MacDonald","Harrison MacDonald","Lisa Chandler","Benjamin Sutherland","Stefania Indelicato","Brian Quintero","Veronica Long","Linus Roache","Matthijs van de Sande Bakhuyzen","David Cubitt","Reilly Dolman","Josh Cruddas","Alexis Sides","Mark Krysko","Jasmine Vega","David LeReaney","Manuel Uriza","Ana-Maria Alvarado","Nuria Vega","Tom Carey","Ty Olsson","Josh Zaharia","Clay St. Thomas","Douglas Vermeeren","Sandy Robson","Javier Lacroix","Miguel Castillo","Sean Depner","Anthony Lemke","Shaun Smyth","Hannah Galway","Chris Enright","Michel Issa Rubio","Anne Hawthorne","Griffin Cork","Christopher Heyerdahl","Paul McGillion","Mark Day","Toby Hargrave","Billy Wickman"],"screenwriters":["Michael Hirst"],"cinematographers":["Ronald Paul Richard","Paul Sarossy","Sylvaine Dufaux","Craig Powell"],"composers":["Mark Korven","Michelle Osis"],"reviews":[{"author":"dannyyy","text":"1. sériebyla taková rozjížděcí, ale velmi dobrá. Takový westerníček na dobrou noc. Za to2. sériebyla od prvního do posledního dílu našlapaná, skoro nonstop westernová akce. Chrochtal jsem si blahem. Jediné mínus je, že už to mohli zakončit. Fanoušci westernů ví, jak dopadne setkání dvou bývalých přátel Pata a Kida. Vše tomu nasvědčovalo, že k tomu dojde, ale tvůrci se rozhodli, že to protáhnou do další série. Tak doufám, že další série přijde brzy a nebude jí brzdit stávka scénáristů, tak jako to bylo u té druhé série.(29.06.2024)","stars":5},{"author":"lardko","text":"Nebylo to špatné, ale místy nudné, a nelíbilo se mi jak udělali z Billyho takového slušňáka.(01.04.2023)","stars":4},{"author":"cernymotyl","text":"I přes spoustu nesmyslů a chyb je seriál koukatelný. Přestřelky jsou uvěřitelné a zbraně v nich autentické.(04.10.2024)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Canal+","url":"https://www.canalplus.cz/stream/series/billy-the-kid/?utm_campaign=vod_content&utm_content=feed&utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=partner&utm_term="}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/1107898-billy-the-kid/prehled/","root_id":1107898,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":3,"episode_count":24,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2023-10-15","last_vod_date":"2025-11-23","episodes":[{"season_no":2,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2023-10-15","title":"The Road to Hell (